Unitree G1 motion clips bundled in this directory
==================================================

`dance1_subject2.npz` was produced by running mjlab's `csv_to_npz` converter
(forward-kinematics replay through MuJoCo Warp) on the matching CSV from the
Unitree-retargeted LAFAN1 dataset:

  Source CSV  https://huggingface.co/datasets/lvhaidong/LAFAN1_Retargeting_Dataset
              (path: g1/dance1_subject2.csv)
  Original    Ubisoft LAFAN1 Motion Capture dataset
              https://github.com/ubisoft/ubisoft-laforge-animation-dataset

